  <gsn>
    <g
        id="__gsn__18db882c3f2"
        color="#ffffff"
        name="Acceptable Zone Alert Service">
      The Zone Alert Service solves the Impending Zone Violation Unawareness problem.

      <s
          id="__gsn__18fc0625209"
          color="#ffffff"
          name="Strategy">
        By showing that we have succeeded in the development of dependable software.

        <j
            id="__gsn__1915d6ce896"
            color="#ffffff"
            name="Justification">
          This is the classic model of software engineering as presented by John Knight in his book.
        </j>

        <m
            id="__gsn__18db9043dd7"
            color="#ffffff"
            name="Understood Problem">
          The Imminent and Existing Zone Violation Detection Problem is sufficiently understood.
        </m>

        <m
            id="__gsn__18fc062567b"
            color="#ffffff"
            name="A Likely Solution is Proposed">
          An OpenUxAS Zone Violation Alert Service applying Vehicle Velocity Projection is likely to solve the Imminent and Existing Zone Violation Detection Problem
        </m>

        <m
            id="__gsn__18fc06259c1"
            color="#ffffff"
            name="Correct Implementation of the Solution">
          The OpenUxAS Zone Violation Alert Service is a correct implementation of the proposed Zone Alert Service solution.
        </m>

        <m
            id="__gsn__18fc0627746"
            color="#ffffff"
            name="The Solution is Confirmed to Solve the Problem">
          The OpenUxAS Zone Violation Alert Service is confirmed to solve the Imminent and Existing Zone Violation Detection Problem
        </m>
      </s>
    </g>
  </gsn>
